      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[On-Device Agent · ReAct-Toolkette]\n\n💭 Thought: Abfrage der lokalen Wissensdatenbank zu LLM-Architektur.\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch (ADR-011, RAG_GOVERNANCE)\n\n👁️ Observation: 3 relevante Dokumente gefunden.\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n[Wissensdatenbank-Zusammenfassung: LLM-Design]\n1. Datenschutz an erster Stelle: 100%% offline im Sandbox.\n2. Apple Silicon Beschleunigung: Über 40 Tok/s durch ANE.\n3. Hybrid-RAG: FTS5 Volltextsuche kombiniert mit Vektoren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[On-Device Agent · ReAct Tool Execution Chain]\n\n💭 Thought: User requested a summary of on-device LLM architecture from local knowledge base. Invoking hybrid search tool.\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch\n• Parameters: {\"query\": \"on-device LLM architecture RAG offline\", \"topK\": 3}\n• Hit Documents: ADR-011 Architecture, RAG_GOVERNANCE, INFRASTRUCTURE\n\n👁️ Observation: Retrieved 3 documents. Key points: strict L0-L3 layering, Apple Silicon ANE acceleration, FTS5 + vector hybrid RAG.\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n[Local Knowledge Base Summary: LLM Design]\n1. Local-First & Zero-Leak: All weights, KV cache, and queries execute strictly in sandbox.\n2. Hardware-Aware Acceleration: Unified memory mmap and ANE matrix acceleration enable 40+ Tok/s.\n3. Hybrid RAG Verification: BM25 keyword matching combined with dense vector embeddings provide hallucination-free citations."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Agente en el dispositivo · Cadena ReAct]\n\n💭 Thought: Buscando en la base de conocimientos sobre la arquitectura LLM.\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch\n\n👁️ Observation: 3 documentos encontrados.\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n[Resumen de la base de conocimientos: Diseño LLM]\n1. Privacidad total: Ejecución 100%% local sin red.\n2. Aceleración con ANE: Más de 40 Tok/s.\n3. RAG híbrido: Búsqueda FTS5 y similitud vectorial combinadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Agent sur l appareil · Chaîne ReAct]\n\n💭 Thought: Recherche documentaire sur l architecture LLM locale.\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch\n\n👁️ Observation: 3 documents clés identifiés.\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n[Synthèse de la base de connaissances: Conception LLM]\n1. Confidentialité absolue: Exécution hors ligne dans la sandbox.\n2. Accélération ANE: Plus de 40 Tok/s.\n3. RAG hybride: Combinaison FTS5 et similarité vectorielle."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Agente sul dispositivo · Catena ReAct]\n\n💭 Thought: Consultazione della knowledge base locale sull architettura LLM.\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch\n\n👁️ Observation: Trovati 3 documenti chiave.\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n[Riepilogo Knowledge Base: Architettura LLM]\n1. Privacy nativa: Elaborazione interamente offline.\n2. Accelerazione ANE: Velocità superiore a 40 Tok/s.\n3. RAG ibrido: Ricerca combinata FTS5 e vettoriale."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[デバイス内エージェント · ReAct 思考とツール連携]\n\n💭 Thought: ローカルナレッジベースからLLM設計要約を検索中...\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch\n• 検索クエリ: 「オンデバイスLLM設計 RAG」\n• ヒット文書: ADR-011, RAG_GOVERNANCE, INFRASTRUCTURE\n\n👁️ Observation: 設計文書3件取得完了。\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n【ナレッジベース要約：大モデル設計】\n1. 完全オフラインとプライバシー保護：外部通信ゼロ。\n2. ANEアクセラレーション：低消費電力と40+ Tok/sの高速生成。\n3. ハイブリッドRAG：FTS5とベクトル類似度による高精度回答。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[온디바이스 에이전트 · ReAct 실행 체인]\n\n💭 Thought: 온디바이스 LLM 설계에 대한 로컬 지식베이스 검색 수행.\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch (ADR-011, RAG_GOVERNANCE 검색)\n\n👁️ Observation: 로컬 문서 3건 검색 완료.\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n【로컬 지식베이스 요약: 대형 언어 모델 아키텍처】\n1. 오프라인 우선: 데이터 유출 없는 완전 온디바이스 추론.\n2. ANE 하드웨어 가속: 40+ Tok/s 처리 속도 달성.\n3. 하이브리드 RAG: FTS5 키워드 및 벡터 유사도 융합."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Agente no dispositivo · Cadeia ReAct]\n\n💭 Thought: A pesquisar na base de conhecimento sobre arquitetura LLM.\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch\n\n👁️ Observation: 3 documentos encontrados.\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n[Resumo da Base de Conhecimento: Design LLM]\n1. Privacidade total: Execução estritamente no dispositivo.\n2. Aceleração ANE: Mais de 40 Tok/s.\n3. RAG Híbrido: FTS5 combinado com vetores densos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[端侧智能体 · ReAct 思考与工具调度链]\n\n💭 Thought: 用户请求总结本地知识库中关于大模型方案设计的内容。我需要调用本地知识库混合检索工具 (Hybrid FTS5 + Vector Cosine) 检索相关核心设计文档。\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch\n• 检索参数: {\"query\": \"大模型方案设计 离线推理 RAG 架构\", \"topK\": 3, \"minScore\": 0.82}\n• 命中本地文档:\n  1. [ADR-011] 端侧大模型接入与物理隔离架构\n  2. [RAG_GOVERNANCE] 智宇检索增强生成治理与双阶段重排规范\n  3. [INFRASTRUCTURE] 存储引擎与本地神经网络推理中台设计\n\n👁️ Observation: 本地文档检索完成，关键设计要点提取完毕：\n• 分层解耦：L1.5 领域层与底层 Core ML/GGUF 推理引擎严格物理隔离，业务逻辑通过依赖倒置注入；\n• 离线算力：充分利用 Apple Silicon ANE (Apple Neural Engine) 专用矩阵加速单元，降低能耗并保持毫秒级 TTFT；\n• 混合召回：SQLite FTS5 BM25 词法全文检索与向量嵌入余弦精排混合互补，保障私域知识问答零幻觉。\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n【智宇本地知识库 · 大模型方案设计核心总结】\n智宇面向端侧离线 AI 知识系统构建了完整的大模型落地闭环方案，核心涵盖三大支柱：\n1. 纯本地离线与隐私优先 (Local-First & Zero-Leak)：模型权重、KV-Cache 与对话历史全部存留于设备沙盒，不消耗外部网络，杜绝私密知识外泄。\n2. ANE 硬件加速与内存池治理：通过权重内存映射 (mmap) 与统一内存零拷贝，将模型常驻占用控制在设备预算之内，实现 40+ Tok/s 的高吞吐生成。\n3. 混合 RAG 深度检索验证：将语义分块后的知识碎片建立倒排索引与高维向量，在推理时无缝注入 System Context，实现带深度原文引用的可靠问答。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[端側智能體 · ReAct 思考與工具調度鏈]\n\n💭 Thought: 用戶請求總結本地知識庫中關於大模型方案設計的內容。調用本地知識庫混合檢索工具檢索核心設計文檔。\n\n🔧 Action: KnowledgeSearch\n• 檢索參數: {\"query\": \"大模型方案設計 離線推理 RAG 架構\", \"topK\": 3}\n• 命中本地文檔: ADR-011, RAG_GOVERNANCE, INFRASTRUCTURE\n\n👁️ Observation: 文檔檢索完成，關鍵設計要點提取完畢。\n\n🎯 Final Answer:\n【智宇本地知識庫 · 大模型方案設計核心總結】\n1. 純本地離線與隱私優先：所有推理完全在設備沙盒執行，外部網絡調用為零。\n2. ANE 硬體加速與記憶體治理：實現 40+ Tok/s 高吞吐生成。\n3. 混合 RAG 深度檢索驗證：SQLite FTS5 與向量語義打分互補，保障問答精準可靠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
