    "model_manager.lab.response.prompt_lab_creative_format": {
      "comment": "Prompt lab creative sampling response",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Prompt Lab · Kreative Abtastung (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nPrompt: \"%3$@\"\n\n[Kreativer Text]\nIm ersten Morgenlicht ruht der Samen in dunkler, feuchter Erde. Eine Rose zu pflanzen ist ein Geduldsritual, das im Verborgenen wächst, bis scharlachrote Blütenknospen die Welt verzaubern.\n\n[Mechanik-Analyse]\n• Temperature (%1$@): Erhöht poetische Varianz.\n• Top-P (%2$@): Schützt vor Halluzinationen bei maximaler Bildhaftigkeit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Prompt Lab · Creative Exploration (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nPrompt: \"%3$@\"\n\n[Creative Synthesis]\nAt the first break of dawn, nestle the cool morning seeds into rich dark soil. Growing a rose is an intimate ritual of patience: deep underground, it gathers sustenance, unfurling delicate red thorns and serrated leaves. As the sepals tremble in the breeze and scarlet petals emerge, an entire sanctuary awakens.\n\n[Sampling Mechanics Analysis]\n• Temperature (%1$@): Flattens logit distribution, boosting expressive sensory vocabulary.\n• Top-P (%2$@): Nucleus threshold truncates nonsensical tail tokens while preserving vivid imagination."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Laboratorio de Prompts · Muestreo creativo (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nPrompt: \"%3$@\"\n\n[Síntesis creativa]\nCon las primeras luces del alba, el grano se sumerge en tierra fértil. Cultivar una rosa es un acto de paciencia que florece en un estallido escarlata.\n\n[Análisis de muestreo]\n• Temperature (%1$@): Eleva la riqueza expresiva.\n• Top-P (%2$@): Preserva la armonía narrativa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Prompt Lab · Échantillonnage créatif (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nPrompt: \"%3$@\"\n\n[Texte créatif]\nÀ la première lueur de l aube, déposez la graine dans la terre nourricière. Faire éclore une rose est un rituel de patience jusqu à l éveil des pétales écarlates.\n\n[Analyse des paramètres]\n• Temperature (%1$@): Stimule la richesse métaphorique.\n• Top-P (%2$@): Maintient la cohérence stylistique."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Laboratorio Prompt · Campionamento creativo (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nPrompt: \"%3$@\"\n\n[Composizione creativa]\nAlla prima luce dell alba, il seme trova dimora nella terra scura. Coltivare una rosa è un rito di dedizione fino allo sbocciare dei petali scarlatti.\n\n[Analisi parametri]\n• Temperature (%1$@): Accresce la profondità poetica.\n• Top-P (%2$@): Conserva la fluidità testuale."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[プロンプトラボ · 創造的サンプリング (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nプロンプト: 「%3$@」\n\n【文学的表現】\n朝露を含んだ土の深くに種を埋める。薔薇を育てることは静寂の儀式であり、暗闇の中で力を蓄え、鮮やかな棘と若葉を伸ばしていく。一輪の紅が風に揺れ綻ぶ時、庭園全体が生命を宿す。\n\n【サンプリング解析】\n• Temperature (%1$@): 表現豊かな語彙のサンプリング確率を向上。\n• Top-P (%2$@): 文脈の破綻を防ぎつつ詩的な広がりを両立。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[프롬프트 랩 · 창의적 탐색 (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\n프롬프트: \"%3$@\"\n\n【문학적 표현】\n새벽 첫 햇살이 대지를 적실 때, 차가운 이슬을 머금은 씨앗을 촉촉한 흙 깊숙이 묻습니다. 장미를 피우는 것은 인내의 의식입니다. 어둠 속에서 자양분을 흡수하며 붉은 가시와 푸른 잎을 펼쳐냅니다.\n\n【샘플링 메커니즘 분석】\n• Temperature (%1$@): 표현력이 풍부한 단어의 채택 확률 증가.\n• Top-P (%2$@): 문맥 일관성을 유지하며 상상력을 극대화."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Laboratório de Prompts · Amostragem criativa (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nPrompt: \"%3$@\"\n\n[Síntese criativa]\nCom os primeiros raios de sol, a semente repousa na terra húmida. Plantar uma rosa é um tributo à paciência até desabrochar em rubro esplendor.\n\n[Análise de amostragem]\n• Temperature (%1$@): Desperta maior inventividade.\n• Top-P (%2$@): Assegura coerência semântica."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[提示词实验室 · 高发散度创意采样 (Temperature: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\n关于您的提示词：“%3$@”\n\n【文学与意象生成】\n在清晨第一抹曙光浸透泥土时，将带有微凉晨露的种子埋入松软的黑壤深处。玫瑰不仅是植物的繁衍，更是耐心的仪式——它在黑暗中悄悄吮吸腐殖质的养分，抽出发红的嫩刺与锯齿状青叶。当花萼在微风中轻微颤动、第一瓣绯红破茧而出时，整座花园便在掌心悄然苏醒。\n\n【端侧采样超参数原理解析】\n• Temperature (%1$@): 较高采样温度平滑了词表 Logits 分布，大幅提升低频感官词元（如“晨露”、“绯红”、“破茧”）的选取概率，生成语感更加抒情且富有艺术张力。\n• Top-P (%2$@): 核采样累积概率区间有效裁切了语义失控的长尾奇异词，在激发文学想象力的同时确保了文本的叙事逻辑与韵律美感。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[提示詞實驗室 · 高發散度創意採樣 (Temperature: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\n關於您的提示詞：“%3$@”\n\n【文學與意象生成】\n在清晨第一抹曙光浸透泥土時，將帶有微涼晨露的種子埋入鬆軟的黑壤深處。玫瑰不僅是植物的繁衍，更是耐心的儀式——它在黑暗中悄悄吮吸腐殖質的養分，抽出身帶微刺的青葉。當花萼在微風中輕微顫動、第一瓣緋紅破繭而出時，整座花園便在掌心悄然甦醒。\n\n【端側採樣超參數原理解析】\n• Temperature (%1$@): 較高採樣溫度平滑了詞表 Logits 分佈，提升低頻感官詞元的選取概率。\n• Top-P (%2$@): 核採樣有效裁切長尾奇異詞，兼顧文學想像力與敘事邏輯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "model_manager.lab.response.prompt_lab_deterministic_format": {
