      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Prompt Lab · Deterministische Abtastung (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nPrompt: \"%3$@\"\n\n[Botanische Anleitung]\n1. Boden: pH 6.0-6.8, gut durchlässig;\n2. Aussaattiefe: 0.5-1.0 cm;\n3. Klima: 18-22°C, 45-55%% Feuchtigkeit;\n4. Licht: Mindestens 6 Stunden Licht täglich.\n\n[Parameteranalyse]\n• Temperature (%1$@): Deterministische, sachliche Fakten.\n• Top-P (%2$@): Fokus auf Kernanweisungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Prompt Lab · Deterministic Mode (Temp: %1$@, Top-P: %2$@)]\n\nPrompt: \"%3$@\"\n\n[Botanical Cultivation Protocol]\n1. Soil Mix: Well-draining slightly acidic loam (pH 6.0-6.8);\n2. Sowing Depth: 2-3 times seed diameter (~0.5-1.0 cm);\n3. Environment: 18-22°C ambient temperature, 45-55%% soil moisture;\n4. Lighting: Minimum 6 hours daily direct or diffused sunlight after sprouting.\n\n[Sampling Mechanics Analysis]\n• Temperature (%1$@): Sharpens logits towards greedy selection for strict repeatability.\n• Top-P (%2$@): Constrains nucleus to high-probability technical terms."
