          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下是一段基于 Swift 6 严格并发模式 (Complete Concurrency) 的 Actor 线程安全内存缓存实现：\n\n```swift\nimport Foundation\n\n/// 线程安全通用泛型缓存 Actor (Swift 6)\npublic actor MemoryCache<Key: Hashable & Sendable, Value: Sendable> {\n    private struct CacheEntry {\n        let value: Value\n        let expiration: Date?\n    }\n    \n    private var storage: [Key: CacheEntry] = [:]\n    private let defaultTTL: TimeInterval?\n\n    public init(defaultTTL: TimeInterval? = nil) {\n        self.defaultTTL = defaultTTL\n    }\n\n    /// 读取缓存项，过期自动失效\n    public func get(_ key: Key) -> Value? {\n        guard let entry = storage[key] else { return nil }\n        if let expiration = entry.expiration, expiration < Date() {\n            storage.removeValue(forKey: key)\n            return nil\n        }\n        return entry.value\n    }\n\n    /// 写入缓存项\n    public func set(_ value: Value, for key: Key, ttl: TimeInterval? = nil) {\n        let effectiveTTL = ttl ?? defaultTTL\n        let expiration = effectiveTTL.map { Date().addingTimeInterval($0) }\n        storage[key] = CacheEntry(value: value, expiration: expiration)\n    }\n\n    /// 移除单项\n    public func remove(_ key: Key) {\n        storage.removeValue(forKey: key)\n    }\n\n    /// 清空缓存\n    public func clear() {\n        storage.removeAll()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Swift 6 核心并发保障**：\n1. **状态隔离**：`actor` 隔离内部 `storage` 字典，所有外部调用必须通过 `await` 异步调度，在编译期杜绝数据竞争 (Data Race)。\n2. **Sendable 契约**：泛型形参 `Key` 与 `Value` 均声明 `Sendable` 约束，确保跨并发域传递的数据指针完全符合线程安全隔离规范。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下是一段基于 Swift 6 严格并发模式 (Complete Concurrency) 的 Actor 线程安全内存缓存实现：\n\n```swift\nimport Foundation\n\n/// 线程安全通用泛型缓存 Actor (Swift 6)\npublic actor MemoryCache<Key: Hashable & Sendable, Value: Sendable> {\n    private struct CacheEntry {\n        let value: Value\n        let expiration: Date?\n    }\n    \n    private var storage: [Key: CacheEntry] = [:]\n    private let defaultTTL: TimeInterval?\n\n    public init(defaultTTL: TimeInterval? = nil) {\n        self.defaultTTL = defaultTTL\n    }\n\n    /// 读取缓存项，过期自动失效\n    public func get(_ key: Key) -> Value? {\n        guard let entry = storage[key] else { return nil }\n        if let expiration = entry.expiration, expiration < Date() {\n            storage.removeValue(forKey: key)\n            return nil\n        }\n        return entry.value\n    }\n\n    /// 写入缓存项\n    public func set(_ value: Value, for key: Key, ttl: TimeInterval? = nil) {\n        let effectiveTTL = ttl ?? defaultTTL\n        let expiration = effectiveTTL.map { Date().addingTimeInterval($0) }\n        storage[key] = CacheEntry(value: value, expiration: expiration)\n    }\n\n    /// 移除单项\n    public func remove(_ key: Key) {\n        storage.removeValue(forKey: key)\n    }\n\n    /// 清空缓存\n    public func clear() {\n        storage.removeAll()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Swift 6 核心并发保障**：\n1. **状态隔离**：`actor` 隔离内部 `storage` 字典，所有外部调用必须通过 `await` 异步调度，在编译期杜绝数据竞争 (Data Race)。\n2. **Sendable 契约**：泛型形参 `Key` 与 `Value` 均声明 `Sendable` 约束，确保跨并发域传递的数据指针完全符合线程安全隔离规范。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
